                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9338: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gauss</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-14T14:00:00-04:00">August 14, 1937—2
                        p.m.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>216. Your 467, August 13, 3 p.m., and 473, August 13, 9 p.m. I heartily approve
                    the action taken by you.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
